## 9. Troubleshooting

| Issue | What to check |
|-------|----------------|
| `Excel file not found` | Path in `excel_path`; run from correct directory or use absolute path. |
| Root holon error | Exactly one row with empty `Parent` in `Structure`. |
| Missing `AHP_<Holon>` | Sheet name and holon name must match; matrix size = number of criteria. |
| Missing criterion / DM | Raw criteria must appear in `DM_<Holon>`; child holons must be defined in `Structure`. |
| Alternatives mismatch | If `Alternatives` sheet exists, every `DM_*` must list all of them. |
| AHP labels error | Labeled AHP sheets must include every criterion name in row and column. |
| CR always `REVIEW` | Revise pairwise judgments or lower `cr_threshold` only if methodologically justified. |

